            <title>[IGNITE-2042] Collocated mode is broken for IgniteSet with BinaryMarshaller</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2042</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If BinaryMarshaller is used then &apos;collocated&apos; mode does not work for IgniteSet. To reproduce run &lt;br/&gt;
GridCachePartitionedAtomicSetSelfTest.testIteratorCollocated.&lt;/p&gt;

